        "heading": "UV Shield+",
        "subhead": "Daily support for active, sun-ready skin†",
        "body": "<p>UV Shield+ combines five ingredients selected for complementary nutritional and antioxidant roles:</p><ul><li>Niacinamide</li><li>Polypodium leucotomos</li><li>EGCG</li><li>Trans-resveratrol</li><li>Spirulina</li></ul><p>Its formulation is designed around broader coverage of environmental and oxidative-stress biology rather than reliance on one ingredient alone.</p><p><strong>Key support areas:</strong> environmental stress, antioxidant support, outdoor lifestyle support, skin resilience.†</p>",
        "product": "uv-shield",
        "primary_label": "Explore UV Shield+",
        "asset": "lifestyle-uvshield-rocks.webp",
        "ratio": "4x5"
      }
    },
    "step2": {
      "type": "feature-split",
      "settings": {
        "color_scheme": "light",
        "image_side": "left",
        "eyebrow": "",
        "heading": "Dermaboost+",
        "subhead": "Daily immune support for calm, balanced skin†",
        "body": "<p>Dermaboost+ combines eight vitamins, minerals, carotenoids, and botanical ingredients selected for broader nutritional, antioxidant, and normal immune-supportive roles:†</p><ul><li>Niacinamide</li><li>Vitamin D3</li><li>Vitamin C</li><li>Zinc</li><li>Quercetin</li><li>Curcumin</li><li>Olive leaf extract</li><li>Astaxanthin</li></ul><p>The formulation rationale identifies several complementary pairings within Dermaboost+, including quercetin + curcumin, quercetin + vitamin C, quercetin + astaxanthin, curcumin + olive leaf, and vitamin C + zinc.</p><p><strong>Key support areas:</strong> antioxidant support, normal immune function, nutritional skin support, daily skin resilience.†</p>",
        "product": "dermaboost",
        "primary_label": "Explore Dermaboost+",
        "asset": "lifestyle-dermaboost-yacht.webp",
        "ratio": "4x5"
      }
    },
    "antioxidant": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "settings": {
        "color_scheme": "dark",
        "align": "left",
        "width": "wide",
        "eyebrow": "",
        "heading": "Outdoor life creates more than one type of stress.",
        "heading_tag": "h2",
        "body": "<p>Environmental exposure can contribute to oxidative stress in skin.† The body responds through multiple antioxidant systems, which is why the Sun Resilience Duo uses chemically different ingredients rather than relying on one antioxidant.</p><p>Across both formulas, the bundle includes:</p><ul><li>Niacinamide</li><li>Polypodium leucotomos</li><li>EGCG</li><li>Resveratrol</li><li>Spirulina</li><li>Vitamin C</li><li>Quercetin</li><li>Curcumin</li><li>Olive leaf polyphenols</li><li>Astaxanthin</li><li>Zinc</li></ul><p><em>Antioxidant support does not mean blocking UV radiation or replacing sunscreen.</em></p><h3>Not all antioxidants work the same way.</h3><p>A polyphenol is not the same as a vitamin. A carotenoid is not the same as a mineral. Different compounds have different chemical structures, cellular locations, and biological roles. That is the formulation rationale behind Sun Resilience Duo.</p><p><strong>UV Shield+</strong> leans heavily on botanical polyphenols and environmental-stress support.†</p><p><strong>Dermaboost+</strong> adds vitamins, minerals, carotenoids, and broader botanical support.</p>",
        "quote": "Complementary does not mean identical."
      }
    },
    "immune": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "settings": {
        "color_scheme": "light",
        "align": "left",
        "width": "wide",
        "eyebrow": "",
        "heading": "Skin is an immune-active organ.",
        "heading_tag": "h2",
        "body": "<p>Skin participates in the body’s interaction with the external environment. Normal immune function therefore matters to broader skin health.</p><p>Dermaboost+ contributes nutrients such as:</p><ul><li>Vitamin D3</li><li>Vitamin C</li><li>Zinc</li></ul><p>which have established roles in normal immune physiology.</p><p><em>Supporting normal immune function is not the same as treating immune-mediated disease.</em></p><h3>Resilience is the goal, not perfection.</h3><p>Skin is constantly:</p><ul><li>Renewing</li><li>Responding</li><li>Adapting</li><li>Maintaining barrier function†</li><li>Interacting with the environment</li></ul><p>The Sun Resilience Duo is built around supporting those everyday processes from two directions: <strong>environmental support</strong> with UV Shield+ and <strong>broader nutritional support†</strong> with Dermaboost+.</p>"
      }
    },
